        {
          "id": 685516159,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The idea for the ancient URL (and it had been ancient when I originally added it) was, that it is the original URL for the library. The update does not reflect the original copyright information and any relation to the original author, except a small reference to the contrib/minizip subdirectory. \n\nFor copyright reasons, I would actually prefer keeping the old link intact, as it is the right point-of-information",
